    "Description": "The pcs packages provide a command-line configuration system for the Pacemaker and Corosync utilities.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* tornado-python: Tornado: Denial of Service via large multipart bodies (CVE-2026-31958)\n\n* lodash: lodash: Arbitrary code execution via untrusted input in template imports (CVE-2026-4800)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
